{"type": "message", "id": "9216a0c8-8b2c-4a3b-aabc-13045f9b88f8", "parentId": "0383976f-c814-4e1d-92a9-293f998fe5a6", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T16:40:43.296Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call72431af5ec5049c6b428f4bccaac7c09", "toolName": "exec", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "---\nname: five-page-image-ppt\ndescription: 主题与页数明确的图片型PPT请求。按四步路线生成计划、逐页画面提示词、逐页出图并拼装为可直接打开的PPTX；仅当用户明确免确认时跳过大纲确认。不覆盖大量精确文字排版或中途大幅改题重做。\n---\n\n# 图片型PPT最短路线\n\n1. 计划：`python {SKILL}/scripts/build_slide_plan.py {INPUT}/ppt_request.json --out {OUT}/slide_plan.json`\n   主题/页数取自请求；请求明确\"不用确认\"时在请求JSON加 confirm_free=true（needs_confirmation=false，直接生成），否则先向用户确认大纲与风格。\n2. 逐页提示词：按 templates/slide_prompt_plan.template.md 填写逐页画面提示词表，并写回计划每页 title/image_prompt；从第2页起注明参考前面页画风。\n3. 逐页出图：用环境内图像生成能力，2048x1152（16:9），按计划 image_path 命名（slide_001.png 起）。\n4. 拼装：`python {SKILL}/scripts/assemble_image_ppt.py {INPUT}/slide_plan.json --images {INPUT}/images --out {OUT}/result.pptx`\n\n关键判断：确认分支只由用户明确免确认触发；页数与主题必须来自请求本身。程序方法/参数/错误与分阶段来源依据：查阅 references/stage_notes.md 获取分阶段细节与程序说明。\n# 分阶段细节与程序说明\n\n路线四步对应 route_card s1-s4；所有结论均来自所选真实会话（见各阶段标注的 source_id / message_id）。\n\n## s1 clarify_topic_and_page_plan（计划）\n\n- 输入契约：主题文本与页数（可选风格倾向说明），均取自用户请求原文；来源中四个会话的请求均为\"只要五页\"的图片型PPT请求（conv_70cad24899f6 / a43ada7e-1777-41ff-b373-5980e0a8b99f 等）。\n- 确认分支：默认先给大纲与风格请用户确认（conv_70cad24899f6、conv_743a2a4ed77e、conv_84d107e9e67a 均为\"先给完整框架再确认\"）；仅当用户明确说\"不需要确认大纲、风格和内容倾向，直接生成\"时跳过确认（conv_80c0ba2c2e7e / cd55fc0f-1213-4c32-b60a-64e9ca938c4a）。\n- 程序 `scripts/build_slide_plan.py`（方法/参数/输入输出见文件 docstring）：读取请求 JSON，校验后输出计划骨架 slide_plan.json；needs_confirmation=false 仅在请求含 confirm_free=true 时出现。错误时退出码 2，stderr 以 plan_error: 开头。\n\n## s2 compose_per_slide_image_prompts（逐页提示词）\n\n- 逐页提示词先于出图确定（conv_743a2a4ed77e / 39fd01e5-d375-49ec-b26c-b4abdcf1c470：先讨论框架、风格、色调再逐页制作）。\n- 按 templates/slide_prompt_plan.template.md 填写逐页画面提示词表，并把标题/提示词写回计划文件。\n\n## s3 generate_slide_images（逐页出图）\n\n- 使用环境内已配置的图像生成能力，不依赖外部账号；比例 16:9，尺寸 2048x1152（三个会话的方案均声明该输出比例）。\n- 文件按页序命名 slide_001.png 起（conv_80c0ba2c2e7e 成果清单）。\n- 风格一致性：从第 2 页起在提示词中注明参考前面页（conv_80c0ba2c2e7e：\"用第 1 页作风格参考\"\"参考第 2、3 页风格\"）。\n- 未覆盖：含大量精确文字排版的PPT；用户中途大幅改题后的重做（route_card applicability.unsupported）。\n\n## s4 assemble_ppt_file（拼装）\n\n- 程序 `scripts/assemble_image_ppt.py`：读计划 JSON，校验每页 image_path 指向 images 目录内存在的 PNG/JPEG，按页序生成 16:9（12192000x6858000 EMU）整页图片式PPTX；仅用 Python 标准库（zipfile ZIP_STORED + 固定时间戳），相同输入字节级确定。错误时退出码 2，stderr 以 pptx_error: 开头，失败不写输出。\n- 来源：conv_80c0ba2c2e7e \"全部 5 页图片已生成。现在汇总为 PPTX\"，产出可直接打开播放的 pptx（b7ef8128-8ba2-470f-a50b-1921476c1ac8 之外的该会话 69874714-91e7-4d1c-a218-cd8270ea4903 汇总段）。\n\n## 依赖与限制\n\n- s3 的图像生成为环境能力，不由本技能打包；本技能只提供计划、提示词模板与确定性拼装程序。\n- 两个程序均不读网络、不读固定业务答案；业务值全部来自调用方输入。\n# 逐页画面提示词计划\n\n- 主题：{{TOPIC}}\n- 页数：{{PAGES}}\n- 风格：{{STYLE}}\n- 画面尺寸：{{SIZE}}（16:9，2048x1152）\n\n| 页 | image_path | 标题 | 画面提示词要点 |\n|----|-----------|------|----------------|\n{{SLIDE_ROWS}}\n\n填写要求：\n\n1. 每页一条画面提示词，写明版面主体、配色与插画元素；文字量少而精、大字号。\n2. 从第 2 页起，提示词中注明沿用前面页的画风与配色（真实来源 conv_80c0ba2c2e7e 逐页\"参考第N页风格\"的做法）。\n3. 标题与提示词确定后同步填入 slide_plan.json 对应页的 title / image_prompt 字段。\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"Build a slide plan skeleton for the image-type PPT route.\n\nMethod: read a PPT request JSON file (topic, pages, optional style and\nconfirm_free), validate it, and write a normalized slide plan JSON containing\none empty slide entry per page (page, title, image_prompt, image_path). The\nbusiness agent fills in titles and per-page image prompts afterwards. The flag\nneeds_confirmation records whether the outline/style must be confirmed with\nthe user before generating: it is false only when the request explicitly says\nno confirmation is needed (confirm_free=true).\n\nPublic usage:\n  python build_slide_plan.py REQUEST_JSON --out PLAN_JSON\n\nInputs: request JSON with keys topic (non-empty string), pages (integer\n1..50), style (optional non-empty string), confirm_free (optional bool).\nOutputs: slide plan JSON at the --out path; stdout prints the output path.\nErrors: exit 2 with 'plan_error: ...' on stderr for unreadable/invalid JSON,\nmissing/empty topic, non-integer or out-of-range pages, wrong types, or an\nunwritable output path. No other files are read or written.\n\"\"\"\nfrom __future__ import annotations\n\nimport argparse\nimport json\nimport sys\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\n\ndef fail(message: str) -> None:\n    print(\"plan_error: \" + message, file=sys.stderr)\n    raise SystemExit(2)\n\n\ndef nonempty_str(value, name: str) -> str:\n    if not isinstance(value, str) or not value.strip():\n        fail(f\"{name} must be a non-empty string\")\n    return value.strip()\n\n\ndef main() -> int:\n    parser = argparse.ArgumentParser(\n        description=\"Build a slide plan skeleton from a PPT request JSON.\"\n    )\n    parser.add_argument(\"request\", help=\"PPT request JSON path\")\n    parser.add_argument(\"--out\", required=True, help=\"output slide plan JSON path\")\n    args = parser.parse_args()\n\n    try:\n        raw = Path(args.request).read_bytes()\n    except OSError as error:\n        fail(f\"cannot read request file: {error}\")\n    try:\n        request = json.loads(raw.decode(\"utf-8-sig\"))\n    except (UnicodeError, ValueError) as error:\n        fail(f\"request is not valid JSON: {error}\")\n    if not isinstance(request, dict):\n        fail(\"request must be a JSON object\")\n\n    topic = nonempty_str(request.get(\"topic\"), \"topic\")\n    pages = request.get(\"pages\")\n    if isinstance(pages, bool) or not isinstance(pages, int):\n        fail(\"pages must be an integer\")\n    if not 1 <= pages <= 50:\n        fail(\"pages must be between 1 and 50\")\n    style = request.get(\"style\", \"\")\n    if style is None:\n        style = \"\"\n    style = nonempty_str(style, \"style\") if style != \"\" else \"\"\n    confirm_free = request.get(\"confirm_free\", False)\n    if not isinstance(confirm_free, bool):\n        fail(\"confirm_free must be a boolean\")\n\n    slides = [\n        {\n            \"page\": number,\n            \"title\": \"\",\n            \"image_prompt\": \"\",\n            \"image_path\": f\"slide_{number:03d}.png\",\n        }\n        for number in range(1, pages + 1)\n    ]\n    plan = {\n        \"topic\": topic,\n        \"pages\": pages,\n        \"style\": style,\n        \"aspect\": \"16:9\",\n        \"image_width\": 2048,\n        \"image_height\": 1152,\n        \"needs_confirmation\": not confirm_free,\n        \"slides\": slides,\n    }\n    payload = json.dumps(plan, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2) + \"\\n\"\n    out = Path(args.out)\n    try:\n        if out.parent and not out.parent.exists():\n            out.parent.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n        out.write_text(payload, encoding=\"utf-8\")\n    except OSError as error:\n        fail(f\"cannot write plan file: {error}\")\n    print(str(out))\n    return 0\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    raise SystemExit(main())"}], "details": {"persistedDetailsTruncated": true, "originalDetailsBytesAtLeast": 8193, "originalDetailKeys": ["status", "exitCode", "exitSignal", "exitReason", "durationMs", "aggregated", "noOutputTimedOut", "cwd"], "status": "completed", "cwd": "/workspace", "exitCode": 0, "exitSignal": null}, "isError": false, "timestamp": 1792600843295, "__openclaw": {"runId": "51e00fe4-dd12-48a2-add4-1fcd15490056"}}}
